# Personal-pack snippet (process/personal/README.md §16 and §18 step 4):
# paste into the installed tools/bootstrap.sh, after the personal pack's
# own identity lines (process/personal/templates/bootstrap-identity.sh.template).
# Idempotent, cheap, and non-blocking -- prints a notice only, never gates
